          "_name": "toggle2",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"toggle2\" group=\"Accordion & Toggles & Tabs\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background':bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mbr-switch-arrow\">\n    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Media on Right/Left\" name=\"reverseContent\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Media Size\" name=\"mediaSize\" min=\"20\" max=\"200\" step=\"1\" value=\"71\">\n        <select title=\"Toggles Count\" name=\"bootstrapAccordion\">\n             <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n             <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n             <option value=\"3\" selected>3</option>\n             <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n             <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n             <option value=\"6\">6</option>\n        </select>\n\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background4.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uNCr7NdOJgw\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.9\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>    \n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                    <div class=\"toggle-content\">\n                        <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title pb-3 align-left mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                            Toggle with media\n                        </h2>\n                        <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-left mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n                            Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua.\n                        </h3>\n                        <div id=\"bootstrap-toggle\" class=\"toggle-panel accordionStyles tab-content pt-5 mt-2\">\n                            <div class=\"card\">\n                                <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n                                    <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse1\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>→ ¿Que aprenderás?</b></h4>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div id=\"collapse1\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\">\n                                    <div class=\"panel-body p-4\">\n                                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">¿Quieres aprender herramientas prácticas y basadas en fundamentos sólidos para evaluar situaciones, identificar opciones y actuar con confianza?<br><br><b>La toma de decisiones efectiva es un arte y una ciencia que combina lógica, intuición y análisis. </b>En este curso, descubrirás estrategias avanzadas que te permitirán abordar desafíos con claridad, minimizar riesgos y maximizar resultados positivos en tus elecciones.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapAccordion > 1\">\n                                <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingTwo\">\n                                    <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse2\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>→ ¿Qué te brindará este curso?</b></h4>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div id=\"collapse2\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingTwo\">\n                                    <div class=\"panel-body p-4\">\n                                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\"><b>Herramientas prácticas:</b> Aprenderás a tomar decisiones más efectivas, aplicando métodos probados para analizar problemas y elegir las mejores soluciones.<br><b>Enfoque estratégico:</b> Desarrollarás habilidades para enfrentar situaciones complejas con claridad y confianza, optimizando tus resultados personales y profesionales.<br><b>Transforma tu proceso de decisión: </b>Descubrirás cómo estructurar tus elecciones para minimizar riesgos y maximizar oportunidades de éxito en cualquier área de tu vida.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapAccordion > 2\">\n                                <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n                                    <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse3\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"collapse3\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>→ ¿Por qué este curso es para ti?</b></h4>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div id=\"collapse3\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\">\n                                    <div class=\"panel-body p-4\">\n                                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\"><b>Bases sólidas:</b> Aprenderás los conceptos clave de las funciones cognitivas y emocionales que influyen en la toma de decisiones, permitiéndote entender cómo planificar y ejecutar de manera efectiva.<br><b>Estrategias efectivas:</b> Descubrirás cómo evaluar situaciones, adaptarte a diferentes circunstancias y visualizar resultados para tomar decisiones de forma planificada y segura.<br><b>Herramientas prácticas:</b> Incorporarás técnicas basadas en modelos teóricos y estrategias probadas para estructurar tu proceso de decisión, gestionando emociones y actuando con confianza en cada paso.<br>Este curso te brindará las herramientas necesarias para tomar decisiones con claridad, adaptarte a los cambios y alcanzar tus objetivos con seguridad.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapAccordion > 3\">\n                                <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n                                    <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title  text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse4\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                                            <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span> This is a accordion Title 4\n                                        </h4>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div id=\"collapse4\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\">\n                                    <div class=\"panel-body p-4\">\n                                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">\n                                           Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur in nulla ut magna vehicula libero luctus in ipsum consequat faucibus. Ut porta nulla ac dapibus convallis. Curabitur sit amet massa quam. In ut ex auctor, porta neque quis, sagittis purus. Nunc auctor gravida magna, sed efficitur tortor tristique quis.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapAccordion > 4\">\n                                <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n                                    <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse5\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse5\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                                            <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span> This is a accordion Title 5\n                                        </h4>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div id=\"collapse5\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\">\n                                    <div class=\"panel-body p-4\">\n                                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">\n                                           Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur in nulla ut magna vehicula libero luctus in ipsum consequat faucibus. Ut porta nulla ac dapibus convallis. Curabitur sit amet massa quam. In ut ex auctor, porta neque quis, sagittis purus. Nunc auctor gravida magna, sed efficitur tortor tristique quis.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapAccordion > 5\">\n                                <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n                                    <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse6\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse6\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                                            <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span> This is a accordion Title 6\n                                        </h4>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div id=\"collapse6\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\">\n                                    <div class=\"panel-body p-4\">\n                                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">\n                                           Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur in nulla ut magna vehicula libero luctus in ipsum consequat faucibus. Ut porta nulla ac dapibus convallis. Curabitur sit amet massa quam. In ut ex auctor, porta neque quis, sagittis purus. Nunc auctor gravida magna, sed efficitur tortor tristique quis.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                <div class=\"mbr-figure\" mbr-style=\"{'width': mediaSize + '%'}\">\n                     <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/toma-de-decisiones-1-950x950.png\" alt title>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n</section>",
